Subject: [PATCH 3/5 v2] ASoC: rsnd: call clk_prepare/unprepare() in  probe/remove
Date: Thu, 26 Mar 2015 04:02:09 +0000
Message-ID: <87d23w5rvo.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
References: <87h9t85ry1.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
